 {"label":"Inputs","value":"Last 10 games per team through Nov 16, 2026 for LAL, SAS, NYK, PHI, GSW, TOR, DET, BOS (80 team-games). Box scores from FantasyData (most games), plus SI.com, ESPN, NBA.com, CBS Sports and FantasyTeamAdvice where FantasyData wasn't reachable. Every game checked: player points sum to the team's final score. Opponent defensive rank/efficiency from the team-defense tab (ESPN opponent stats, 18 Nov 2026). Minutes rounded to the nearest minute."}]
json.dump({'rows':rows,'meta':meta},open('players_last10.json','w'))
